    - target: {fileID: 3686973092905522621, guid: 3b78f404deb68354e9b08eaf5d093c61,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: description
      value: Anisotropic filtering factors in the camera's viewing angle. Instead
        of taking a standard square sample, it stretches the sampling area to match
        the perspective distortion, keeping the texture sharp even when viewed at
        a sharp, grazing angle.
