      propertyPath: title
      value: AlphaToMask
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6701903472308983855, guid: e22c1831a6e25ff4999ccd41af9a55c5,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: description
      value: '[ToDo: Description about AlphaToMask]


        Note: The result will
        depend on your Anti-Aliasing level and apparently your graphics card.

        -
        For Nvidia cards, the output seems to be differnt layers of transparency.

        -
        For AMD Graphics cards, the output seems to be dithered, meaning you can
        see individual pixels despite Anti-Aliasing.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
