        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: Trilinear filtering takes the smooth blending a step further by smoothly
        transitioning between different mipmaps. When combined with Anisotropic filtering,
        this delivers the cleanest result, eliminating both jagged artifacts and
        sudden blurry transitions.
